    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJM290HPDBJ3XQMCYW\">You will learn </h2>\n<p>Learn how to boost your site’s SEO and overall online presence using Klaviyo Reviews. Customer reviews can offer SEO benefits by improving your rankings in search results, adding keyword-rich content to your product pages, and helping you understand the language your customers use to find what they need. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJDXJ5NNQ0AWK2TNVD\">About reviews and SEO </h2>\n<p>Search engines are built to help searchers find the content they’re looking for. To do this, search engine algorithms consider myriad factors to determine which sites are trustworthy and relevant. Collecting and featuring customer reviews on your site can help with many of these factors, including:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Keywords </strong><br>\nReviews are keyword-rich, which helps search engines know what queries to rank your pages for.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Internal linking</strong><br>\nHighlighting reviews across your site creates a network of links among your site pages.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Content recency</strong><br>\nBecause customers regularly submit new reviews, your content is continually updated. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Reputation</strong><br>\nA history of primarily positive reviews demonstrates the legitimacy of your business, </li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJS79JASS2A17HR1XK\">Do negative reviews hurt my SEO? </h3>\n<p>The short answer: no. All businesses will receive at least a small percentage of negative reviews. In fact, a smattering of negative reviews sprinkled among many glowing, positive reviews helps visitors feel assured that your reviews are legitimate. </p>\n<p>Search engines won’t penalize you for a handful of poor reviews. Instead, they’ll look at the overall themes and sentiment of your reviews over time, and use that to determine your site’s trustworthiness. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJCWHCSEBQ8YF6G8YA\">How to improve your SEO with reviews</h2>\n<p>To improve your SEO using Klaviyo Reviews:  </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Add the SEO / All reviews widget to your site</li>\n<li>Sync review to Google Shopping </li>\n<li>Enable rich snippets </li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJTSX79GEE73GMVYY3\">The SEO widget </h3>\n<p>The SEO / All reviews widget features every single review you receive (including both product and store reviews). Search engines can crawl this page to read your most recent reviews. Create a standalone <em>All reviews</em> page on your site to feature this widget. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/30346368363803\" alt=\"The SEO/All reviews widget\" width=\"507\" height=\"268\"></p>\n<p>Learn how to add the SEO / All reviews widget on: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16318951826331\">Shopify 2.0 themes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16318891028635\">Shopify (vintage themes and headless)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/26922347702939\">WooCommerce</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJYGNR3FQJNXHMGHKQ\">Sync reviews to Google Shopping</h3>\n<p>Sync your reviews directly to Google Shopping so searchers can see product reviews and star ratings from their Shopping search results. </p>\n<p>Learn how to <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16681460907035\">sync reviews to Google Shopping</a>. </p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JAZM5AVJ6JH61Y5856EBZ68D\">Enable rich snippets </h3>\n<p>Rich snippets allow Google to highlight product details, including a product’s star rating, directly within search results. This can make your product pages more visually appealing in search results, and gives browsers key information before they even land on your site. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/30346340849051\" alt=\"Google results with rich snippets enabled\" width=\"278\" height=\"143\"></p>\n<p>Learn how to <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/24707161844507\">enable rich snippets</a>. </p>",
